        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Mario and Luigi are back on the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "silver screen",
            "zh": "银幕"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Super Mario Galaxy Movie"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《超级马力欧银河大电影》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is now in theaters. It is the "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "sequel"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Super Mario Bros. Movie"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《超级马力欧兄弟大电影》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This time, the brothers leave the Mushroom Kingdom for a much more exciting journey."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the sequel, Mario, Luigi, and their new friend, Yoshi, join Princess Peach and Toad on an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "adventure",
            "ref": "v-adventure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " into "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "outer space",
            "ref": "v-outer-space"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In the first movie, they stopped Bowser, a fire-breathing monster, from marrying Princess Peach. But the brothers face a new "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "threat",
            "ref": "v-threat"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " this time. They must "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "face off",
            "zh": "对抗"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " against Bowser Jr., Bowser’s son. He wants to free his father from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "captivity",
            "zh": "囚禁"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Luckily for fans, the sequel is made by the same team that made the first movie. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cast",
            "zh": "演员阵容"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " includes all the fan-favourites. Chris Pratt and Charlie Day return as Mario and Luigi, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "respectively",
            "ref": "v-respectively"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". And Shigeru Miyamoto, the creator of Super Mario Bros, is once again one of the film’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "producers",
            "ref": "v-producer"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He helped the movie stay true to the famous video game."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "From the Mushroom Kingdom to outer space, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Super Mario Galaxy Movie"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is ready to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "level up",
            "ref": "v-level-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the fun. If you enjoyed the first movie, this space adventure may be the next wild ride you’ve been waiting for!"
          }
        ]
      },
